{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39156","headline":"家叔南游却归因献贺 · 韦庄","name":"家叔南游却归因献贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缭绕江南一岁归，归来行色满戎衣。\n长闻凤诏徵兵急，何事龙韬献捷稀。\n旅梦远依湘水阔，离魂空伴越禽飞。\n遥知倚棹思家处，泽国烟深暮雨微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}